-- so Upload History isn't empty. invoice_id is nulled below since the
-- invoice this originally created isn't part of the frozen catalogue
-- snapshot above -- the audit log entry above still references it by id
-- for history's sake, same as any audit trail referencing a since-deleted
-- record.
