-- The actual PDF (db/demo/files/01_Invoice_Sample.pdf) is NOT loaded by
-- this SQL file -- Postgres can't write into MinIO. See README for the
-- separate `mc` command that uploads it to the right object_key so
-- "view original PDF" works. Without that step, this row's list entry,
-- status, and extraction result all still display correctly; only the
-- PDF preview/download will fail.

